# 77. PERSONAL PERFORMANCE VS SIGNALRANK PERFORMANCE

Distinguish:

```text
SignalRank strategy performance
```

from:

```text
Your account performance
```

because users can:

- enter late;
- manually close;
- ignore signals;
- change size;
- change stops;
- alter positions.

Never attribute manual-user outcomes entirely to SignalRank.

---

